            "review_title": "Review at The Crab Shack Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Hoa V\n11 contributions\n0\nMust try seafood spot\nDec 2025 • Family\nI’ve been a regular customer of The Crab Shack for many years and have visited several of their branches. The Thao Dien location continues to deliver consistently good quality seafood, especially the crabs.\n\nThe food is flavorful, portions are generous, and the service is friendly and attentive. The atmosphere is relaxed and comfortable, making it an easy place to come back to.\n\nA dependable choice if you’re looking for good seafood in Thao Dien.\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2025",
