            "review_title": "Review at The Crab Shack Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Dream49408054093\n1 contribution\n0\nReview one of the best seafood restaurant in Vietnam\nSep 2025 • Family\nThe Crab Shack is a great place for seafood lovers. The restaurant has a warm and cozy atmosphere with golden and brown tones, wooden tables, and soft yellow lights that make it feel both elegant and friendly. It is a nice spot for both family meals and gatherings with friends.\n\nThe menu offers a variety of dishes, but crab is the highlight. The Cajun-style crab is especially popular, with a rich and slightly spicy sauce that goes perfectly with toasted bread. Other seafood such as shrimp, oysters, and scallops are also fresh and well-cooked. The staff is friendly, the service is quick, and although the price is not cheap, it is worth the quality. Overall, The Crab Shack is a wonderful place to enjoy tasty seafood in a welcoming setting\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nVisit The Crab Shack early to avoid waiting. Try the Cajun-style crab, the best dish here. Portions are big, so share with friends.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 20, 2025\nCrab Shack\nHi dear, thank you so much for taking the time to share your experience with us.\nWe’re really grateful to know you felt comfortable at our restaurant and enjoyed your meal. It truly means a lot to us. \nThank you again for your support. We hope to welcome you back soon. 🦀❤️\nRead more\nWritten November 26, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
